{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"body":"Second plan review BLOCK remediation (2026-08-10): the remaining findings are fully mechanical. Clarify that snippet lookup uses a parallel case-preserving searchable string plus a lowercased comparison copy, and that the bounded snippet may come from any field that caused the match, including a comment/tag/identifier, without returning a full body. Explicitly rebind `OUTPUT_SCHEMAS[\"search\"]` and add `search.llm`, update the MCP schema coverage binding, and update `docs/output-schemas.md`. No user decision is required."},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1786396697578753001,"uuid":"55162b95-5d40-418b-9e8d-616f0ffcb71b"}